{
  // Override config for `deno task test:integration`. Identical to deno.json EXCEPT
  // it omits the `test.exclude` of `integration/`. Deno's `test.exclude` filters
  // explicitly-passed paths too — so `deno test integration/` under the default
  // config finds "No test modules found". Pointing the integration task at this
  // exclude-free config is what lets the integration tests run, while bare
  // `deno test` (precheck, every commit) keeps using deno.json and stays unit-only.
}
